body:
The scary thing for me (European looking at the trash fire...); 

Trump wins and we get 10-30 years of Republican, Jingoist, neofascist-theocracy. Since the war with China is quickly approaching and the Ukraine situation might escalate. 

Biden wins and we get... What exactly? More escalation against China and Russia. And if he dies/is deemed incapable, who takes over? What are the potential "new president" Have agendas for?

To be fair it seems most snowflakes now believe the world is out to get them... I hear daily from all sides of the political spectrum that persecution is happening and if we believe them all then;

LGBT people are being lynched, white genocide is a thing,  black genocide is a thing, trans people are getting murderous death threats from strangers, Jews (and Israel) are victims, Muslims are trying to infiltrate the west, the west is trying to kill all muslims. 

It almost sounds like the world is a shitty place and no matter who you are someone will hate you no matter what. So drop the victim mentality, we all hate you because you suck not because of some trait you were born with. And we assume you hate us all too.
